**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
server/data
loadtest-results
docs
client/tests
# Nothing below is needed at runtime. Keep it out of the build context (it is uploaded to
# Fly's remote builder) and out of the image: local logs and the tunnel's report secret,
# test fixtures, load-test output, and any spreadsheet / key file that lands in the tree.
**/loadtest-results
server/test
server/loadtest
.tunnel-logs
**/*.log
**/__pycache__
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.csv
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*service-account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
